                                "sense_id": "4fe8b578-f60d-3f9e-8c13-a201f14a142e",
                                "text": "It was mainly men who attended the event and of the women there, most came with gay men and appeared to be faghags. In fact, when the dancing started, the scene looked more like a punky hetero event, except for the presence of a few queens and fairies."
